# round 119 (w136): two blocks of width 36 with 019's KL graph regularizer on the SECOND block ([S,M] soft; ESS_GRAPH_REG=1, one relation per head, lambda 6.5e-5), the first essentiality cell on which the regularizer is not inert. Paired against w135. Split into packs of THREE seeds (2026-09-27): the KL cell materializes the regularized block's attention, about 14.5 GB a seed on a 46 GB card, and six concurrent seeds ran out of memory (jobs 2900 and 2908 lost seeds 2703 to 2705). This pack carries seeds 2703 to 2705.
